    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "kXsO8",
      "x": 6360,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "Notes: Theme.bs tokens → SceneGraph fields",
      "width": 2000,
      "fill": "#141416",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 28,
      "padding": 60,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "S4WvI",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "$primaryText",
          "content": "Notes: Theme.bs tokens → SceneGraph fields",
          "fontFamily": "Montserrat",
          "fontSize": 48,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "kVhLk",
          "name": "Note",
          "fill": "$secondaryText",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Every frame is 1920 × 1080 (manifest ui_resolutions=fhd). Montserrat stands in for Roku's system font (font:SystemFontFile, font:BoldSystemFontFile): real widths differ, so check line fits on a device (step 15). The video still is a placeholder gradient; channel logos are placeholder tiles (Posters, loadDisplayMode scaleToFit). Pen draws the glass rims as strokes; on Roku the rim, fill and sheen are all inside the 9-patch. Nothing is blurred. Minimum type is 24 px (16 px at 720p).",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "Montserrat",
          "fontSize": 24,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "lwIrb",
          "name": "Note: 3-px grid",
          "fill": "$primaryText",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "3-px grid (Roku, \"Specifying display resolution\"): an HD Roku scales this FHD canvas by 2/3, so every position, width, height, spacing, radius and font size in Theme.bs and in these frames is a multiple of 3 and lands on whole pixels at 720p, with no 1-px jitter when grids scroll. Fonts stay at 24 or more. Text line heights are set so a line is a multiple of 3 (24 → 30, 27 → 33, 30 → 36, 45 → 54, 48 → 60). Only guide cells are drawn 1 px inside their 3-px slot: that is guide_cell.9.png's transparent inset (1 px left and top, 2 px right and bottom). The widths of auto-sized text still follow the font.",
          "lineHeight": 1.375,
          "fontFamily": "Montserrat",
          "fontSize": 24,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Wr180",
          "name": "Section",
          "fill": "$primaryText",
          "content": "Colours (Theme.colors())",
          "fontFamily": "Montserrat",
          "fontSize": 30,
